{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46169","headline":"东阳罹乱後怀王慥使君五首 三 · 贯休","name":"东阳罹乱後怀王慥使君五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲郡无如王使君，一家清冷似云根。\n货财不入崔洪口，俎豆尝闻夫子言。\n须发坐成三载雪，黎氓空负二天恩。\n不堪西望西风起，纵火崑仑谁爲论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}